{"nodes":[{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 刘海98种｜五行十元总索引｜配图版\n\n**五行分类：98/98｜参考图：98/98**\n\n图片直接取自冻结研究库所指向的原研究 Canvas；这里只按五行重新编排，不另建第二套研究。\n\n[[../00_研究建库冻结备份_2026-08-03/README.md]]\n[[01_98项五行十元分库总表.md]]","x":-700,"y":-850,"width":1400,"height":560,"color":"4"},{"id":"wood","type":"text","text":"## 木｜zx ↔ nx｜18项\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/3-long-blonde-hairstyle-with-beach-waves-and-bangs.jpg?resize=500%2C537&ssl=1)\n\n[[五行库/木/木_zx-nx.canvas]]\n\n阳木6｜阴木12｜已配图18张","x":-1900,"y":0,"width":700,"height":760,"color":"4"},{"id":"fire","type":"text","text":"## 火｜zn ↔ x｜19项\n\n![](https://therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/10-curtain-bangs-for-curly-hair.jpg)\n\n[[五行库/火/火_zn-x.canvas]]\n\n阳火8｜阴火11｜已配图19张","x":-950,"y":0,"width":700,"height":760,"color":"1"},{"id":"earth","type":"text","text":"## 土｜n ↔ x并z｜33项\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/5-see-through-korean-bangs.jpg?resize=806%2C953&ssl=1)\n\n[[五行库/土/土_n-x并z.canvas]]\n\n阳土21｜阴土12｜已配图33张","x":0,"y":0,"width":700,"height":760,"color":"6"},{"id":"metal","type":"text","text":"## 金｜xn ↔ z｜18项\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/9847xSR6Q27uSbjVbFfvbQGJwJA%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/megan-664f89de405b4cd189a603b727900d26.jpg)\n\n[[五行库/金/金_xn-z.canvas]]\n\n阳金11｜阴金7｜已配图18张","x":950,"y":0,"width":700,"height":760,"color":"5"},{"id":"water","type":"text","text":"## 水｜xz ↔ nz｜10项\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/4-wispy-korean-bangs-for-long-hair.jpg?resize=830%2C1032&ssl=1)\n\n[[五行库/水/水_xz-nz.canvas]]\n\n阳水9｜阴水1｜已配图10张","x":1900,"y":0,"width":700,"height":760,"color":"2"},{"id":"rules","type":"text","text":"## 当前口径\n\n1. 原研究库保留，五行库只重新编排。\n2. 每项保留原编号、名称、参考图、来源页。\n3. 木18＋火19＋土33＋金18＋水10＝98。\n4. 五行库不是五大主题库。","x":-800,"y":980,"width":1600,"height":520,"color":"3"}],"edges":[{"id":"e1","fromNode":"title","toNode":